<pj-nav title="我的纸趣"/><view class="page"><view class="row hero"><image class="brand" src="/assets-logo.png"/><view><view class="title">纸趣 PaperJoy</view><view class="subtitle">让每一张纸都有新乐趣</view></view></view><view class="card"><view>{{logged ? '已登录 · 收藏已关联账号' : '访客模式 · 无需登录也能领取'}}</view><view class="muted">本机收藏与领取记录保留在当前设备。</view><button wx:if="{{loginEnabled &amp;&amp; !logged}}" class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="login">微信登录并同步收藏</button><button wx:if="{{logged}}" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></view><view class="section-title">{{logged ? '账号领取记录' : '本机领取记录'}}</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{syncError}}">{{syncError}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.resourceId}}" bindtap="detail"><view class="card-title">{{item.resourceTitle}}</view><text class="meta">{{item.createdAt}}</text></view><view class="state" wx:if="{{!items.length}}">还没有领取记录</view><view class="card"><button bindtap="feedback">意见与问题反馈</button><button wx:if="{{support}}" bindtap="copySupport">复制联系信息</button><button data-type="privacy" bindtap="legal">隐私说明</button><button data-type="terms" bindtap="legal">使用与版权说明</button></view></view>
